## Why This Is Asked

This question probes practical PCA application in streaming scenarios for a beginner level. It highlights data cleaning, real-time constraints, and translating math into actionable alerts.

## Key Concepts

- IncrementalPCA for streaming data
- Windowed imputation and per-feature scaling
- Variance-based component retention
- Interpreting loadings as operational drivers
- Drift detection via loading-vector similarity

## Code Example

```javascript
// Pseudo: incremental PCA on streaming batches
const pca = new IncrementalPCA({nComponents:8});
for (const batch of stream) {
  const x = preprocess(batch); // impute, scale
  pca.partialFit(x);
  const scores = pca.transform(x);
  // use scores for anomaly scoring
}
```

